   "source": [
    "# TabPFN follow-up on full-data cohort + mined FPs (VLST)\n",
    "\n",
    "Builds a cohort exactly as requested:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **All positives** from the original dataset (`VLST.csv`).\n",
    "2. **True negatives sampled from original dataset** with count equal to positives.\n",
    "3. **All mined false positives** from `false_positives_union_test.csv` (union export from `fp_precision_mining`).\n",
    "\n",
    "Then splits this combined cohort into train/validation/test and fits TabPFN.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Defaults**\n",
    "- Full data path: `/kaggle/input/datasets/amirmahdidaraei/vlst-data/VLST.csv`\n",
    "- FP outputs dir: `VLST_FP_OUTPUT_DIR` if set, else `/kaggle/working/vlst_fp_mining_output` on Kaggle.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Env (optional)**\n",
    "- `VLST_FULL_DATA_PATH` (override CSV path)\n",
    "- `VLST_FULLDATA_TARGET_COL` (force target column)\n",
    "- `VLST_FP_OUTPUT_DIR`, `VLST_FP_RUN_TAG`\n",
    "- `TABPFN_TOKEN`\n"
   ]
  },
